---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie policy"
  description="Cookies used on poesis.cloud and docs.poesis.cloud, and how to manage your consent."
  pageType="Legal"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-doc">
      <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-note">Last updated: 2026-08-16.</p>

      <h2>What we use</h2>
      <table class="compare">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Cookie</th>
            <th>Purpose</th>
            <th>Provider</th>
            <th>Duration</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>_ga</code></td>
            <td>Google Analytics — distinguishes visitors (pseudonymous ID)</td>
            <td>Google</td>
            <td>2 years</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>_ga_*</code></td>
            <td>Google Analytics — session state</td>
            <td>Google</td>
            <td>2 years</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>
        These cookies are <strong>only set if you accept</strong> analytics
        cookies. If you reject them, Google Analytics runs without cookies
        (consent mode), collecting no cookie-based data.
      </p>

      <h2>Managing your consent</h2>
      <p>
        You can change your choice at any time: click
        <a href="#" data-cookie-settings>Cookie settings</a> (also in the site
        footer) to reopen the consent banner and accept or reject.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can also delete cookies through your browser settings. Rejecting
        analytics cookies does not affect access to any content on the sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Strictly necessary storage</h2>
      <p>
        The sites store your consent choice itself and your documentation theme
        preference (light/dark) in your browser's local storage. These are
        strictly necessary for the sites to function as you configured them and
        do not require consent.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
